<title>BRAZIL: Valepar buys Brazil CVRD for 3.3 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Valepar buys Brazil CVRD for 3.3 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Valepar consortium led by Brazilian steelmaker CSN bought 41.7 percent of voting shares of Brazil's mining giant CVRD for 3.337 billion reais, paying 19.98 percent above the base price, officials said.</p>
</text>
